### 1. Stateless Demo (Forgets context)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hello, my name is Bob."
}

### 2. Stateful Demo (Remembers context)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "test-session",
  "message": "Hello, my name is Charlie."
}

### 3. Stateful Follow-up (Should remember name)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "test-session",
  "message": "What is my name?"
}

### 4. Fetch History API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat/history/test-session

### 5. Clear API
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/chat/clear/test-session

### 6. Test After Clear (Should forget name)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "test-session",
  "message": "What is my name?"
}
